---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Operations for Healthcare Practices and Founder-Led Companies"
  description="We take responsibility for the systems, technology, compliance, and processes your business runs on."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Operations for Healthcare Practices and Founder-Led Companies</h1>
      <p class="lead">We take responsibility for the systems, technology, compliance, and processes your business runs on.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/booking" class="btn">Schedule a Consultation</a>
        <a href="#how-we-help" class="btn-outline">See How We Help</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="alt" id="how-we-help">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>How We Help</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="path-grid">
        <a href="/healthcare-practices" class="path-card">
          <h3>Healthcare Practices</h3>
          <p>Credentialing, payer enrollment, clinical systems, and practice operations.</p>
          <span class="path-cta">See how we help →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/founder-led-companies" class="path-card">
          <h3>Founder-Led Companies</h3>
          <p>Research, vendor evaluation, systems, and operational infrastructure.</p>
          <span class="path-cta">See how we help →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Built for Ambiguity</h2>
        <p>Most operational problems don't come with a clear owner or a clear process. Servare Opus takes responsibility for them anyway — identifying what's missing, building the structure the situation requires, and carrying the work to resolution without needing to be managed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="actions" style="justify-content:center; display:flex;">
        <a href="/about" class="btn-outline" style="color:var(--ink) !important; border-color:var(--ink);">Learn How We Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
